 "press_quotes": [
  {
   "quote": "The enormous aft cockpit of the new Lagoon 60 can be entirely opened onto the water – including the sides of the hull, which unfold like the wings of a butterfly – creating an even larger living area than the generous beam of the 32-foot yacht.  There is also a large forward cockpit, flush with the saloon, and with direct access, which makes this yacht ideal for large parties.",
   "source": "YACHTING WORLD"
  },
  {
   "quote": "A real invitation to travel, this new 60-foot model fits neatly between the Lagoon 55 and the Premium line, which starts with the SIXTY 5.  She charms all on board with her immense living spaces, notably aft, fully open to the sea, and on the extra-large flybridge.",
   "source": "FIGARO NAUTISME"
  },
  {
   "quote": "Always bigger, always more open to the exterior... the race for volume and livable space seems to never end.  And this strikes you right away upon discovering the Lagoon 60.",
   "source": "VOILES ET VOILIERS"
  },
  {
   "quote": "It is the between the « normal » and the superyacht range. The Lagoon 60 promise to be an exceptional catamaran with all attributes - and more – of the pleasure of sailing on two hulls.",
   "source": "YACHT CLASS MONACO"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The flybridge helps create heaps more lounging space, albeit for an extremely high boom. In contrast to the previous generation of Lagoons which had masts positioned aft and larger headsails, VPLP has now moved the mast forward. With the range getting larger and heavier it wanted the mast base on a main bulkhead.",
   "source": "YACHTING WORLD"
  },
  {
   "quote": "The new generation French catamaran combines elegance and spaciousness, offering flexible cabins, a luxurious flybridge, and innovative living areas.",
   "source": "YACHTS CROATIA"
  },
  {
   "quote": "Multihull manufacturer Lagoon, world leader in building cruising multihulls, have gone big with new Lagoon 60 as Sam Jefferson finds out.",
   "source": "YACHTS CROATIA"
  },
  {
   "quote": "Discover Lagoon 60: A luxury sailing catamaran with innovative features and a deep connection to the sea. Boasting an expansive flybridge, saloon bathed in natural light, fluid layouts and innovative opening side terraces, the Lagoon 60 is the latest release from Lagoon Catamarans.",
   "source": "TRADE A BOAT"
  }
 ]
